VIC mask section. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#core-nvic-disable-mask\">CORE_NvicDisableMask<\/a>(const CORE_nvicMask_t *disable)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Disable NVIC interrupts. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#core-nvic-enable-mask\">CORE_NvicEnableMask<\/a>(const CORE_nvicMask_t *enable)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Set current NVIC interrupt enable mask. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#core-yield-nvic-mask\">CORE_YieldNvicMask<\/a>(const CORE_nvicMask_t *enable)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Brief NVIC interrupt enable/disable sequence to allow handling of pending interrupts. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#core-nvic-mask-set-irq\">CORE_NvicMaskSetIRQ<\/a>(IRQn_Type irqN, CORE_nvicMask_t *mask)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Utility function to set an IRQn bit in a NVIC enable/disable mask. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"attributename has-text-right\">void<\/div><div class=\"column\"><div class=\"attributename\"><a href=\"#core-nvic-mask-clear-irq\">CORE_NvicMaskClearIRQ<\/a>(IRQn_Type irqN, CORE_nvicMask_t *mask)<\/div><div class=\"classdescription\"><p style=\"color:inherit\">Utility function to clear an IRQn bit in a NVIC enable/disable mask. <\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div><div class=\"column